      "writtenOn": "2023-01-24T15:27:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s an option, but the checks upstream are all designed to work on a per-commit basis so we need the commit anyway and there\u0027s well defined APIs to extract the file lists for that, so I\u0027ve figured let\u0027s use those and only have one argument.",
